# Celery beat's persistent scheduler state (a shelve of last-run times).
# Runtime state, regenerated on start — and versioning it actively broke
# the scheduler: a truncated .dat was committed with a non-empty .dir, so
# every checkout got a beat that died on boot with "EOFError: Ran out of
# input". No beat ran between April and August 2026 because of it.
backend/celerybeat-schedule*
celerybeat-schedule*

# Runtime logs from dev.py launchers, beside the scheduler state above.
backend/*.log
